7 The font loader
*****************

The ‘zpb-ttf’ system, package ‘ZPB-TTF’, keeps the API of Zachary
Beane's zpb-ttf on top of ‘runes/otf’, so existing programs work
unchanged and can open more fonts: TrueType and CFF/CFF2 outlines,
variable fonts, collections, WOFF and WOFF2.  The original zpb-ttf
manual is ‘otf/doc/index.html’; ‘otf/doc/font-loader-details.md’ lists
what differs from the original and what is not supported.

   A font loader is not thread-safe: it fills its glyph cache lazily.

     (zpb-ttf:with-font-loader (font "LiberationSans-Regular.ttf")
       (let ((glyph (zpb-ttf:find-glyph #\A font)))
         (values (zpb-ttf:family-name font)
                 (zpb-ttf:advance-width glyph)
                 (zpb-ttf:bounding-box glyph))))

