8 OpenType tables
*****************

The ‘runes/otf’ system, package ‘RUNES/OTF’, nickname ‘OTF’, is the
low-level layer under ‘zpb-ttf’.  A font is held in memory once and its
tables are read straight from the bytes without copying.  Every read is
bounds-checked.

