8.3 Web fonts
=============

WOFF compresses each table with zlib; WOFF2 compresses all of them with
Brotli and transforms ‘glyf’, ‘loca’ and ‘hmtx’.  Both are decoded with
the ‘decompress’ system.  ‘open-font-loader’ recognises them by itself;
these functions decode them explicitly.

 -- Function: decode-woff1 source &key verify-checksums
 -- Function: decode-woff2 source
     Decode a WOFF or WOFF2 file from SOURCE, a font-data, an octet
     vector or a pathname, and return a font-data over the plain sfnt; a
     WOFF2 collection becomes a TTC. With VERIFY-CHECKSUMS, each WOFF
     table's checksum is checked.

 -- Function: decode-woff1-metadata source
 -- Function: woff1-private-data source
     A WOFF file's extended metadata XML, decompressed, and its private
     data block; ‘nil’ when absent.


